<file path="docs/BUSINESS_REQUIREMENTS.md">
# BUSINESS_REQUIREMENTS.md

> **Document Purpose**
>
> This document defines the business goals, user expectations, required website functionality, and future roadmap for the KAHF Treasure website.
>
> It does not describe implementation details or UI components.
>
> All design and development decisions should support these business requirements.

---

# Project Information

## Business Name

KAHF Treasure

## Business Type

Premium Alcohol-Free Attar & Islamic Lifestyle Brand

## Industry

Fragrance / Attar / Islamic Lifestyle Products

## Primary Market

Bangladesh

## Business Model

Direct-to-Customer (D2C)

Customers browse products online and place orders primarily through WhatsApp, Facebook Messenger, or direct contact.

Currently there is **no online payment gateway** and **no checkout system**.

---

# Business Goals

The website should help the business achieve the following goals.

## Primary Goals

- Build trust with new customers.
- Present KAHF Treasure as a premium brand.
- Increase WhatsApp orders.
- Make browsing products simple.
- Increase customer engagement.
- Improve conversion rate.
- Strengthen online brand presence.

---

## Secondary Goals

- Improve search engine visibility (SEO).
- Encourage repeat customers.
- Make future expansion easier.
- Support future e-commerce functionality.
- Reduce customer confusion during ordering.

---

# Target Audience

The website is primarily designed for:

- Customers in Bangladesh.
- People interested in premium alcohol-free attar.
- Islamic lifestyle customers.
- Gift buyers.
- Customers looking for long-lasting fragrances.
- Mobile-first users.
- Social-media-driven shoppers.

---

# Brand Position

The business should be perceived as:

- Premium
- Elegant
- Authentic
- Trustworthy
- Islamic
- Modern
- Customer Friendly

The website should create confidence before asking customers to place an order.

---

# Website Objectives

The website should:

- Showcase products professionally.
- Explain the brand story.
- Build customer trust.
- Make product discovery easy.
- Help customers choose the right fragrance.
- Encourage customers to contact the business.
- Increase WhatsApp conversations.
- Support future online shopping features.

---

# Customer Journey

A visitor should naturally move through this flow.

1. Discover the brand.
2. Understand why KAHF Treasure is different.
3. Browse collections.
4. Explore products.
5. Compare options.
6. Build confidence.
7. Contact the business.
8. Place an order.

Every page should reduce friction during this journey.

---

# Required Website Sections

The homepage should include:

- Hero Section
- Brand Story
- Why Choose Us
- Featured Products
- Most Wanted Collection
- New Arrivals
- Oud Collection
- Floral Collection
- Fruit Collection
- Premium Packages
- Customer Reviews
- Frequently Asked Questions
- Contact Section
- Footer

---

# Required Business Features

The website should support:

- Product browsing
- Category browsing
- Collection browsing
- Product search
- Featured products
- Best sellers
- New arrivals
- Stock status
- WhatsApp ordering
- Facebook contact
- Email contact
- Mobile-friendly experience
- Responsive design
- SEO optimization

---

# Product Information Requirements

Every product should eventually support:

- Product Name
- Product Image
- Category
- Short Description
- Price
- Available Sizes
- Fragrance Family
- Fragrance Notes
- Longevity
- Projection
- Recommended Season
- Recommended Occasion
- Gender
- Availability
- Featured Badge
- New Arrival Badge
- Best Seller Badge

Not every product currently contains all of these fields, but the system should be designed to support them in the future.

---

# Trust Building Requirements

The website should communicate:

- Alcohol-Free Products
- Premium Imported Oils
- Long Lasting Fragrance
- Authentic Quality
- Fast Delivery
- Customer Satisfaction
- Secure Ordering Process

Future additions may include:

- Customer testimonials
- Ratings
- Reviews
- Delivery information
- Return policy
- Privacy policy
- Shipping policy

---

# Conversion Requirements

The website should encourage visitors to:

- Browse products.
- Compare fragrances.
- Discover collections.
- Contact through WhatsApp.
- Request recommendations.
- Purchase premium packages.

Every major section should include a clear call-to-action.

---

# Contact Requirements

The website should provide:

- WhatsApp
- Facebook
- Email
- Phone Number
- Business Address (if available)
- Google Maps (future)

Customers should always have an easy way to contact the business.

---

# Content Requirements

The website should contain:

- Brand Story
- Mission
- Vision
- Product Information
- Fragrance Guides
- Frequently Asked Questions
- Ordering Instructions

Future content may include:

- Blog Articles
- Fragrance Education
- Buying Guides
- Seasonal Recommendations

---

# Search Engine Optimization

The website should be optimized for search engines.

Goals include:

- Fast loading speed.
- Mobile optimization.
- Structured metadata.
- Semantic HTML.
- Open Graph support.
- Product schema.
- Organization schema.
- Sitemap.
- Robots configuration.

---

# Accessibility Requirements

The website should be usable for all visitors.

Requirements include:

- Keyboard navigation.
- Proper color contrast.
- Readable typography.
- Screen reader support.
- Reduced motion support.
- Mobile accessibility.

---

# Performance Requirements

The website should prioritize:

- Fast loading.
- Optimized images.
- Minimal JavaScript.
- Good Core Web Vitals.
- Efficient rendering.
- Lightweight components.

---

# Future Business Features

These features are planned but not required for the first release.

## Shopping

- Shopping Cart
- Checkout
- Online Payment
- Cash on Delivery
- Order Tracking

---

## Customer Features

- Wishlist
- Compare Products
- Recently Viewed
- Loyalty Program
- Referral Program
- Coupon System
- Gift Cards

---

## Marketing

- Newsletter Subscription
- Promotional Campaigns
- Discount Banners
- Seasonal Offers

---

## Product Experience

- Product Reviews
- Product Ratings
- Related Products
- Fragrance Finder Quiz
- Personalized Recommendations

---

## Business Management

- Inventory Management
- Admin Dashboard
- Product Management
- Analytics Dashboard

---

# Success Metrics

The redesign should improve:

- WhatsApp inquiries
- Customer trust
- Time spent on the website
- Product discovery
- Mobile experience
- Search engine visibility
- Customer engagement
- Brand perception
- Conversion rate

---

# Business Constraints

The redesign must:

- Preserve all existing product information.
- Preserve existing contact channels.
- Maintain a premium brand identity.
- Remain fast and responsive.
- Be easy to maintain.
- Support future business growth.
- Allow future e-commerce expansion without major redesign.

---

# Final Business Vision

KAHF Treasure should be recognized as one of Bangladesh's most trusted premium alcohol-free attar brands.

The website should not feel like a simple product catalog. It should represent a complete luxury fragrance brand that builds trust, creates desire, and encourages customers to place orders while remaining scalable for future business growth.
</file>

